# One line-ending style on every machine. Without this, Git for Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) checks files out with CRLF, and tests that compare a
# generated file byte-for-byte (packages/tokens: tokens.css) fail on a
# fresh Windows checkout even though nothing is wrong.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.joblib binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf text
